# Long String Allowlist
# Patterns that match known safe long strings (35+ chars) detected by the
# pre-commit hook. These are typically npm paths, Azure API paths, and URLs.
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
# Patterns use grep -E (extended regex) syntax, matched against extracted strings.

